{
  "name": "@workspace.sh/p2p-runtime",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "description": "P2P runtime interface + per-platform implementations. Hypercore + Hyperswarm under the hood.",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./src/index.ts",
  "types": "./src/index.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./src/index.ts",
      "default": "./src/index.ts"
    },
    "./node": {
      "types": "./src/runtime.node.ts",
      "default": "./src/runtime.node.ts"
    },
    "./spawned": {
      "types": "./src/runtime.spawned.ts",
      "default": "./src/runtime.spawned.ts"
    },
    "./ipc": {
      "types": "./src/ipc/index.ts",
      "default": "./src/ipc/index.ts"
    },
    "./ipc/framing": {
      "types": "./src/ipc/framing.ts",
      "default": "./src/ipc/framing.ts"
    },
    "./ipc/macos": {
      "types": "./src/ipc/transport.macos.ts",
      "default": "./src/ipc/transport.macos.ts"
    },
    "./ios": {
      "types": "./src/runtime.ios.ts",
      "default": "./src/runtime.ios.ts"
    },
    "./android": {
      "types": "./src/runtime.android.ts",
      "default": "./src/runtime.android.ts"
    },
    "./ipc/ios": {
      "types": "./src/ipc/transport.ios.ts",
      "default": "./src/ipc/transport.ios.ts"
    },
    "./shims/crypto": {
      "types": "./src/shims/crypto.ts",
      "default": "./src/shims/crypto.ts"
    }
  },
  "_imports_note": [
    "Host-conditional builtins, the convention used by hypercore, hyperswarm and",
    "rocksdb-native. Under Bare these resolve to the bare-* shims; under Node the",
    "map is inert (Node only consults `imports` for `#`-prefixed specifiers) and",
    "`fs` / `os` / `path` resolve to the builtins as usual.",
    "This is what lets runtime.node.ts pack into a Bare worklet bundle. Import the",
    "UNPREFIXED specifiers in source — `node:fs` bypasses this map entirely and",
    "breaks the mobile bundle (#229)."
  ],
  "imports": {
    "fs": {
      "bare": "bare-fs",
      "default": "fs"
    },
    "fs/promises": {
      "bare": "bare-fs/promises",
      "default": "fs/promises"
    },
    "os": {
      "bare": "bare-os",
      "default": "os"
    },
    "path": {
      "bare": "bare-path",
      "default": "path"
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "test": "node --experimental-strip-types --no-warnings --test \"tests/**/*.test.ts\""
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.6"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "b4a": "1.8.0",
    "bare-fs": "4.7.4",
    "bare-os": "3.9.3",
    "bare-path": "3.1.1",
    "compact-encoding": "3.3.0",
    "corestore": "7.9.2",
    "hypercore": "11.33.5",
    "hypercore-crypto": "3.7.0",
    "hyperswarm": "4.17.0",
    "protomux": "^3.11.0",
    "sodium-universal": "5.0.1"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^22.9.0",
    "typescript": "^5.6.0"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "react-native": "*"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "react-native": {
      "optional": true
    }
  }
}
